contract Payments
parties we

thing Payment
  amount HKD
  directors list person at most 5

can disburse by we
  over 1_000_000 requires 2 approvals by directors in person within 7 days
  active -> disbursed

test "two directors approve a large payment"
  we create with amount = HKD 2_000_000, directors = (alice, bob, carol)
  we disburse in person by dave -> pending approval
  we approve in person by alice -> pending approval
  we approve in person by erin -> refused "bo:approver disburse"
  we approve by bob -> refused "bo:in-person disburse"
  we approve in person by bob -> disbursed
